{"title": "[花邊] 太陽把J.Green放上交易台 希望換來控衛", "author": "c27932589 (單推陽菜寶)", "board": "", "date": "Sat Nov 14 16:50:29 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1794646232.A.E1F.html", "body": "https://x.com/underdognba/status/2121493000518090957\n\nThe Suns have made Jalen Green available in trade talks, per @ChrisBHaynes.\n\n\"They've been in the market for a point guard.\"\n\n太陽把Jalen Green放上交易台 希望換來控衛\n\nhttps://x.com/gambo987/status/2121355094113554804\n\nThe Phoenix Suns have had no conversations with the New Orleans Pelicans regardi\nng Dejounte Murray at this time. They have not checked in with them and are not\ncalling around The thought of trading for a PG had a lot to do with unlocking th\ne best version of Devin Booker but Book has played some of his best basketball i\nn years last 4-5 games and the Suns have won 4 of 5. Plus Collin Gillespie would\n likely be the starter if they ever made a change unless it was for a proven vet\neran. The Suns biggest problem is defensive rebounding right now not point guard\n. The connection between Murray's agent Rich Paul and Mat Ishbia is the main rea\nson this has come up. They are friends and Paul has several clients on Phoenix.\nThis is not to say the Suns won't explore trading Jalen Green at some point but\nI would expect that would be down the road.\n\n鳳凰城太陽目前尚未與紐奧良鵜鶘就 Dejounte Murray 交易進行任何對話，他們尚未與鵜\n鶘隊聯繫，也沒有四處打電話。\n\n交易一名控球後衛的想法很大程度上是為了釋放 Devin Booker 的最佳狀態，但 Book 在過\n去 4-5 場比賽中已經打出了多年來的最佳籃球表現，而太陽隊也贏得了 5 場中的 4 場。\n\n此外，如果他們真的進行調整，除非是為了引入一名經驗豐富的老將，否則 Collin Gilles\npie 很可能會成為先發。\n\n太陽隊目前最大的問題是防守籃板，而不是控球後衛。Murray 的經紀人 Rich Paul 與 Mat\n Ishbia 的關係是這件事浮上檯面的主要原因。他們是朋友，而且 Paul 在鳳凰城有幾位客\n戶。\n\n這並不是說太陽隊不會在未來某個時刻探索交易 Jalen Green，但我預計那會是更遲之後的\n事。\n\n心得：\n\n本季薪資36M 差不多剛好能換32M的DJM", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "nt880245", "content": "伽藍可以問問", "time": "11/14 16:51"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "okamifang", "content": "就DJM了", "time": "11/14 16:51"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "okamifang", "content": "水鳥要SG，大腸要PG，一拍即合", "time": "11